## C++
```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <algorithm>
#include <string>

int main() {
    std::string text = "Hello World";
    std::transform(text.begin(), text.end(), text.begin(), ::toupper);
    std::cout << text << std::endl; // Output: HELLO WORLD
    return 0;
}
```

## C#
