| Step | Call | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| 1 | `factorial(10)` | Returns `10 * factorial(9)` |
| 2 | `factorial(9)` | Returns `9 * factorial(8)` |
| ... | ... | ... |
| 9 | `factorial(2)` | Returns `2 * factorial(1)` |
| 10 | `factorial(1)` | Base case → returns `1` |

